### Book Appointment
POST http://localhost:5000/appointment-api/book
Authorization: Bearer your_jwt_token
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "patientId":"patient_id",
    "doctorId":"doctor_id",
    "appointmentDate":"2026-05-10T10:30:00",
    "symptoms":"Fever and headache"
}



### Get All Appointments
GET http://localhost:5000/appointment-api/
Authorization: Bearer your_jwt_token



### Get Appointment By ID
GET http://localhost:5000/appointment-api/appointment_id
Authorization: Bearer your_jwt_token



### Update Appointment Status
PUT http://localhost:5000/appointment-api/update-status/appointment_id
Authorization: Bearer your_jwt_token
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status":"Approved"
}



### Delete Appointment
DELETE http://localhost:5000/appointment-api/delete/appointment_id
Authorization: Bearer your_jwt_token



### Search Appointments By Status
GET http://localhost:5000/appointment-api/search/Pending
Authorization: Bearer your_jwt_token



### Get Doctor Appointments
GET http://localhost:5000/appointment-api/doctor/doctor_id
Authorization: Bearer your_jwt_token



### Get Patient Appointments
GET http://localhost:5000/appointment-api/patient/patient_id
Authorization: Bearer your_jwt_token



### Calendar Events
GET http://localhost:5000/appointment-api/calendar/events
Authorization: Bearer your_jwt_token